@startuml
<style>
root {
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 13
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  LineColor #555555
}
title {
  FontSize 16
  FontStyle bold
  FontColor #1A1A2E
}
arrow {
  LineColor #4A90D9
  FontColor #333333
  FontSize 11
}
actor {
  BackGroundColor #08427B
  LineColor #4A90D9
  FontColor #FFFFFF
}
participant {
  BackGroundColor #EEF4FB
  LineColor #4A90D9
  FontColor #1A1A2E
}
database {
  BackGroundColor #FFF3E0
  LineColor #F5A623
  FontColor #1A1A2E
}
note {
  BackGroundColor #FFFDE7
  LineColor #F9A825
  FontColor #1A1A2E
}
</style>

title VDNS-PM 日常自动填充

actor 用户 as User
participant 网页 as Web
participant 浏览器扩展 as Extension
participant "本地 Agent" as Agent
participant "VDNS / 日志" as VDNS
database 加密云 as Cloud

User -> Web : 打开登录页面
Web -> Extension : 当前顶层 Origin
Extension -> Agent : 账号选择 + Origin + nonce
Agent -> Agent : RouteMap → CredentialID
Agent -> VDNS : 解析当前状态
VDNS --> Agent : Descriptor + ProofBundle
Agent -> Agent : L1～L5 验证
Agent -> Cloud : 获取当前 hash 的 envelope
Cloud --> Agent : 密文对象
Agent -> Agent : 版本 / hash / OriginBinding / AEAD 验证
Agent --> Extension : 一次性密码句柄
Extension -> Agent : 消费句柄
Agent --> Extension : 仅本次填充值
Extension -> Web : 自动填充

note over Agent,Cloud
  日常路径不等待链、VRF 或 SCOPE-ZK
end note
@enduml
